lass="card"><div class="photo">${f.tag?`<span class="tag">${f.tag}</span>`:''}<span class="emoji">${f.emoji}</span></div><div class="details"><b>${f.name}</b><div class="desc">${f.desc}</div><div class="bottom"><span class="price">${rupiah(f.price)}</span><button class="add" onclick="add(${f.id})">+</button></div></div></article>`).join('')||'<div class="empty">Menu tidak ditemukan.</

